# システム登録's 初期化 of a TessronOS there (design 3.10.10, 11.32) on the x64 PC, for
# tools/x64/ui_run64.py with the disk of ui_sysinst64_keep.steps: 初期化する chosen, [開始]
# asks on the warning panel that every object there goes, and 取消 puts it away; nothing
# is written.
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-54c0-7a11-8c22-4d5e6f7054c0
expectsincein 60 sysinst: opened 1
expectsincein 120 sysinst: keep nvmeb 0 -1: 0
waitwin システム登録 30
wait 500
win システム登録
# 初期化する: the switch at 14..474, 310..332 of the work area
click 424 366
wait 500
shot sysinst64_init_chosen
logmark
click 880 288
expectsincein 120 sysinst: plan nvmeb 0 -1: 0
expectsince sysinst: ask 消して登録
wait 800
shot sysinst64_init_ask
key 29
expectsince sysinst: answered 0
wait 300
key 08 01
expectsince sysinst: closed
absent sysinst: started
absent !OACV!
